<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://indie-game-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:05:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>3D 遇见真实世界：Unity Industry Summit 慕尼黑 2026 回顾</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/unity-industry-summit-munich-2026-recap</link><description>从马自达到汉莎、从 F1 模拟器到 13 个演示展位，本届 Unity 行业峰会展示了 AI 智能体、机器人与 3D 数据如何走进真实工业场景。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8801e1c13244265853a1b83e7a63740e1bd0c338</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/unity-industry-summit-munich-2026-recap">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>GTA 6 用了哪些技术？</title><link>https://dev.to/xabdullahahmad/what-tech-is-used-to-develop-gta-6-2poh</link><description>从 C++ 与 Rockstar 自研 RAGE 引擎，到内存管理与帧时间优化，拆解支撑 3A 大作规模开发的技术栈。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:09:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">63fac7f64670aac7bf7b2724aeb2678282f1428b</guid><source url="https://dev.to/xabdullahahmad/what-tech-is-used-to-develop-gta-6-2poh">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Microsoft PIX 2611.19 发布</title><link>https://dev.to/hacksgr/microsoft-pix-261119-4can</link><description>微软把 DirectX 12 性能分析与调试工具 PIX 更新到 2611.19 版，继续服务 64 位 Windows 上的图形调试工作流。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 02:37:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">af012933cba58d9f35628ffcb0a4b52d243821c6</guid><source url="https://dev.to/hacksgr/microsoft-pix-261119-4can">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 5 打造细节丰富的加勒比风情城市环境</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/building-detailed-caribbean-inspired-city-environment-in-unreal-engine-5</link><description>开发者分享了如何为《Caribbean Alleyway》制作受卡塔赫纳老街启发的场景，重点讲了丰富材质与细节的工作流。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:55:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">ff5b80372f63e1bf59708a69046c69d376df90c8</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/building-detailed-caribbean-inspired-city-environment-in-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>Sensor Tower 估算《GTA 6》预购加首日销售额达 23.6 亿美元</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-estimates-gta-6-generated-236bn-in-pre-order-and-launch-day-sales</link><description>Sensor Tower 估算《GTA 6》预购加首日卖出超 2450 万份、收入约 23.6 亿美元，给独立开发者一个衡量 3A 大作首发量级的参照。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:07:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7457a5957156021326e4df098a66c59d2668fdab</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-estimates-gta-6-generated-236bn-in-pre-order-and-launch-day-sales">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>手机还是电脑？如何规划你的游戏操作方案</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/video-game-controls-phone-or-computer</link><description>Unity 官方分六步讲清跨平台操作设计：先理清动作映射，再到真机上测试，适合在写第一行 Unity Spark 提示词之前就定好触屏与手柄两套方案。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">295f14098a6ed36a9d1eadb7d1aa0c2428780b5f</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/video-game-controls-phone-or-computer">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>蓝图退场，UE6 路线图更新：玩法将转向 Verse 与 Scene Graph</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/news/an-update-on-blueprints-and-the-path-to-ue6</link><description>Epic 确认 UE6 项目不再包含蓝图与 Actor Gameplay Framework，玩法开发将转向 Verse 语言和新的 Scene Graph 框架，开发副总裁详解这对现有 UE5 项目意味着什么。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d823e86d8161fc88c46e569db40345265c186914</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/news/an-update-on-blueprints-and-the-path-to-ue6">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>《绯红沙漠》逆向工程笔记：摸清游戏内部管理器结构并写了自动导出工具</title><link>https://dev.to/xsip/crimson-desert-reverse-engineering-358k</link><description>作者逆向拆解《绯红沙漠》的内部结构，发现各类管理器遵循同一模式，顺手写了个自动导出工具在运行时收集偏移量。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:24:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e7275dcf099446d2298a6f2e214fc4768193113c</guid><source url="https://dev.to/xsip/crimson-desert-reverse-engineering-358k">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>《Queen&#x27;s Domain》如何靠硬核打法卖出 25 万份</title><link>https://newsletter.gamediscover.co/p/how-queens-domain-brutalized-its</link><description>一款高难度游戏是怎样冲到 25 万销量的，GameDiscoverCo 复盘了它的打法，并附上本周 Steam 发现动态。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:28:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bc8387e8ce99be865252c2f5c17ec77bcf40ed9a</guid><source url="https://newsletter.gamediscover.co/p/how-queens-domain-brutalized-its">GameDiscoverCo</source></item><item><title>在浏览器里把照片变成 3D 模型：Image to 3D 是怎么工作的</title><link>https://dev.to/imageto3d/turning-photos-into-3d-models-in-the-browser-how-image-to-3d-works-522b</link><description>工具作者自述：上传一张照片，生成模型约 40 秒出带纹理的网格，全程在浏览器完成，可导出 GLB、OBJ 或 STL 直接进 Blender、Unity 或 Three.js，每天免费试用两次。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:31:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b5f568aa499b2127ce26732f5490350e6d95ea28</guid><source url="https://dev.to/imageto3d/turning-photos-into-3d-models-in-the-browser-how-image-to-3d-works-522b">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>《GTA 6》首日销售额达 37.9 亿美元，创下娱乐产品史上最大首发纪录</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-hits-379-billion-in-its-first-day-on-sale-becoming-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history</link><description>Rockstar 宣布《GTA 6》首日零售额 37.9 亿美元，刷新全娱乐品类的首发纪录，给独立开发者一个衡量市场天花板的最新参照。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:24:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b557cf01bc22033d5db2e228c9fc5e746fb16044</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gta-6-hits-379-billion-in-its-first-day-on-sale-becoming-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>GTA 6 正式成为史上最大的娱乐产品首发</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/gta-6-is-officially-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history</link><description>Rockstar 确认 GTA 6 首日零售额近 40 亿美元，超越所有行业的娱乐产品首发纪录，值得独立开发者研究它如何把期待值转化为销量。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">aecda425cee6047d99e8c10e91dbc05ab5733f80</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/gta-6-is-officially-the-biggest-entertainment-launch-in-history">80 Level</source></item><item><title>《侠盗猎车手 VI》成为史上首发规模最大的游戏</title><link>https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/grand-theft-auto-vi-is-officially-the-biggest-video-game-launch-ever</link><description>《GTA VI》首日零售额达 37.9 亿美元、发售前已卖出 3250 万份，创下游戏史上最大首发纪录，独立开发者可以从中一窥 3A 级发行的体量与打法。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:50:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8667bb7ce0b36a47d42d0d5ca3c18029c1c74ee0</guid><source url="https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/grand-theft-auto-vi-is-officially-the-biggest-video-game-launch-ever">Game Developer</source></item><item><title>把 78 张牌的游戏塞进手机屏幕：法国塔罗应用的经验教训</title><link>https://dev.to/babylone01/fitting-a-78-card-game-on-a-phone-screen-lessons-from-a-french-tarot-app-3pdm</link><description>作者在开发塔罗牌应用时，把 78 张牌的 3 至 5 人吃墩玩法搬上 6 英寸横屏，分享了手牌排布与界面取舍上的实战经验。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:40:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5cbb5d40b06b02e6f656c887f628ad0596f36532</guid><source url="https://dev.to/babylone01/fitting-a-78-card-game-on-a-phone-screen-lessons-from-a-french-tarot-app-3pdm">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>AppsFlyer 扩展 Agent Hub 与 MCP 工具，自动化营销工作流</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/appsflyer-expands-agent-hub-and-mcp-tools-to-automate-marketing-workflows</link><description>AppsFlyer 为 Agent Hub 增加了 MCP 工具，让营销人员能用自动化工作流查询并操作数据。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:28:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5a8c0389372c1797cc4b0ee5918cbca08b69700d</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/appsflyer-expands-agent-hub-and-mcp-tools-to-automate-marketing-workflows">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>不写代码也能做手游，还要做得手感好</title><link>https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-make-a-mobile-game-without-coding-and-make-it-feel-good-2cfd</link><description>向 AI 游戏引擎描述想法就能做出真正能玩的手游，难的从来不是代码，而是设计本身。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:22:03 GMT</p